        </direction-type>
        <offset>0</offset>
        <staff>1</staff>
      </direction>
      <direction placement="above">
        <direction-type>
          <words>[form] Canon II: bars 1–10 transposed to G minor with the voices exchanged</words>
        </direction-type>
        <offset>0</offset>
        <staff>1</staff>
      </direction>
      <direction placement="above">
        <direction-type>
          <words>[cpt] LH now leads and RH follows an octave higher from bar 13: the canon works with the voices inverted</words>
        </direction-type>
        <offset>0</offset>
        <staff>1</staff>
      </direction>
      <direction placement="above">
